    "detailed_description": "Join the discord!! - I'd love to hear from you to make the game better!<br><br><strong>Dive into the depths of Gorathar</strong>, an unforgiving cave system teeming with challenges and hidden treasures! Gorathar is a unique rogue-like deckbuilder that tests your strategy, decision-making, and adaptability as you face increasingly difficult monsters in turn-based battles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/4a853208fbf333369a01f399fef6c24d.poster.avif?t=1709298257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/4a853208fbf333369a01f399fef6c24d.webm?t=1709298257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/4a853208fbf333369a01f399fef6c24d.mp4?t=1709298257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>1. <strong>Strategic Deck Management:</strong> With more than 200 unique cards to choose from, build your ultimate deck to conquer the dungeon's trials. Every time you complete a challenge, select one of three random cards to evolve your deck for the next battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/3d3fc68118f44c5ece6fb22b4a591711.poster.avif?t=1709298257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/3d3fc68118f44c5ece6fb22b4a591711.webm?t=1709298257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/3d3fc68118f44c5ece6fb22b4a591711.mp4?t=1709298257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>2. <strong>Innovative &quot;Pocket&quot; Mechanism:</strong> Introducing a new feature in the world of card games - the &quot;Pocket.&quot; You can use your turn\u2019s energy to store cards in your pocket for later use. Cards from your pocket are free until they are discarded, offering a whole new strategic layer. Choose the perfect moment to unleash these pocketed cards and turn the tide of battle!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/7573f9aba1b9c4dadb2b3be47098909b.poster.avif?t=1709298257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/7573f9aba1b9c4dadb2b3be47098909b.webm?t=1709298257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/7573f9aba1b9c4dadb2b3be47098909b.mp4?t=1709298257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>3. <strong>Immersive Gameplay:</strong> Engage with a variety of different monsters, each with its own unique strategy to defeat. The deeper you go into the dungeon, the tougher the challenges become. Will you rise to the occasion?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/ec79cf4ce7646f8a7d432240fb078659.poster.avif?t=1709298257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/ec79cf4ce7646f8a7d432240fb078659.webm?t=1709298257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/ec79cf4ce7646f8a7d432240fb078659.mp4?t=1709298257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>4. <strong>Rewarding Progression:</strong> Unlock upgrades, power-ups, and special abilities as you delve deeper into Gorathar's mysteries. The combination of strategic deck management and innovative gameplay makes every run a new and thrilling experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/64d94aa61f7c0e01da2763b61c95d421.poster.avif?t=1709298257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/64d94aa61f7c0e01da2763b61c95d421.webm?t=1709298257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545950/extras/64d94aa61f7c0e01da2763b61c95d421.mp4?t=1709298257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>5. <strong>Highly Replayable:</strong> With endless combinations of cards and challenges, Gorathar offers countless hours of engaging gameplay. No two runs are ever the same!<br><br>Embark on your medieval adventure, explore the depths of Gorathar, and master the art of the deck. Can you survive the dungeon and unearth its secrets?<br><br>Gorathar awaits your challenge. Will you answer the call?",
